      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Building a network in their shadow requires deeper layers of trust and verification. Commence by finding cutting-edge cyber surveillance experts to discretely scrutinize potential allies' past activity—look for a pattern of subversive work against their current puppet masters. Establish a slow and careful process of recruitment, starting with smaller, less risky dealings that allow relationships to deepen before advancing to more critical objectives. Use psychological profiling to gauge the veracity of a candidate's passion for preserving the true history of the Valerius bloodline. Each new ally must be thoroughly vetted through a combination of testing their loyalty by exposing their resolve and gauging reactions to historical truths. Over time, you should form a solid inner circle of those who are not only devoted to your lineage's legacy but also prepared for the upheavals it may provoke in the established order.",
